      "id": "claim_841c6fe48f564f848060b0dc702ab88a",
      "statement": "A deviation from the constitution requires explicit human approval and a documented rationale, whereas a spec or plan may deviate from itself and simply be updated — this is the one asymmetry in the spec-driven lifecycle, so an AI assistant meeting an apparent task/constitution conflict must stop and ask rather than choose silently.",
