      "id": "claim_aeec17c12fc947a3bbd4479a2075b33e",
      "statement": "Constitution v2.5.0 records a scoped, bounded accepted exception to the Frontend performance-budgeting rule (2-second time-to-interactive on simulated 3G) for the mcm-app web client's cold load only; it covers residual framework weight, is capped by a committed entry-chunk byte budget, and leaves the principle's JavaScript-lazy-loading clause in force.",
